        "html_content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Ficlets - JLaughter</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: Georgia, serif;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            color: #333;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        /* Header */\n        .header {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start; /* Align items to the top */\n            padding: 20px 20px 0 20px; /* Adjust padding to match image */\n            margin-bottom: 40px; /* Space between header and main content */\n        }\n\n        .header .logo {\n            font-size: 3em; /* Adjust to match \"Ficlets\" size */\n            color: #e65c00; /* Orange color */\n            font-weight: normal;\n            line-height: 1; /* Ensure text aligns well */\n            margin-top: 0;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav ul {\n            list-style: none;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            background-color: black; /* Background for the nav bar */\n            height: 40px; /* Fixed height for the nav bar */\n            align-items: center; /* Vertically center text in nav items */\n        }\n\n        .header-nav li {\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        .header-nav a {\n            display: block;\n            padding: 0 20px; /* Padding for each nav item */\n            color: white;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            line-height: 40px; /* Match height of nav bar */\n            white-space: nowrap; /* Prevent wrapping */\n        }\n\n        /* Main Content */\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 2.5em;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        h2 {\n            font-size: 2em;\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        h3 {\n            font-size: 1.2em;\n            margin-top: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold; /* \"Music You Should Try:\" is bold */\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 1em;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #0000EE; /* Standard link blue */\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        strong {\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        em {\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n\n        /* Specific text styles from image */\n        .section-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 25px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .story-list {\n            margin-top: 40px;\n        }\n\n        .story-item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .story-item a {\n            color: #0000EE;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            font-size: 1.1em;\n            display: block; /* Make link take full width */\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .story-item p {\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n            color: #555;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n        }\n\n        /* Footer */\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #eee;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n\n        .footer-left {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: flex-start;\n        }\n\n        .footer-left a {\n            color: #e65c00;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-left p {\n            font-size: 0.8em;\n            color: #777;\n            margin: 0;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .footer-nav ul {\n            list-style: none;\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: flex;\n        }\n\n        .footer-nav li {\n            margin-left: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .footer-nav a {\n            text-decoration: none;\n            color: #0000EE;\n            font-size: 0.9em;\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive adjustments */\n        @media (max-width: 600px) {\n            .header {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: center;\n                padding-top: 10px;\n                margin-bottom: 20px;\n            }\n\n            .header .logo {\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n                font-size: 2.5em;\n            }\n\n            .header-nav ul {\n                width: 100%;\n                justify-content: space-around;\n            }\n\n            .header-nav a {\n                padding: 0 10px;\n            }\n\n            .footer {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                align-items: center;\n                text-align: center;\n                margin-top: 30px;\n            }\n\n            .footer-left {\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n                align-items: center;\n            }\n\n            .footer-nav ul {\n                flex-wrap: wrap;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .footer-nav li {\n                margin: 0 10px 5px 10px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <h1 class=\"logo\">Ficlets</h1>\n        <nav class=\"header-nav\">\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Authors</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Stories</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Tags</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>JLaughter</h1>\n\n        <p>I've always been an avid (dare I say: <strong>OBSESSED</strong>) reader, and started writing fiction somewhere around 5th or 6th grade. I read approximately 3 or 4 books a month, so new material is always a must!</p>\n\n        <p>I've written for a long time now, although the novel I started in high school has never gotten past the first draft stage. Over the last four years, I've fallen out of the habit of writing and I'm looking to ramp that up again.</p>\n\n        <p>I'm going to insert a shameless plug for my father. Jim Laughter and Victor J. Bretthauer recently published <strong>Escape to Destiny</strong>, and his book (and oncoming series) is available on <a href=\"#\"><strong>tatepublishing.com</strong></a> !</p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\">Music You Should Try:</h3>\n        <p><strong>The Dears</strong>, <em>No Cities Left</em><br>\n        <strong>Sia</strong>, lots of albums...great voice.</p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\">Ficlet Series' in Progress :</h3>\n        <p><strong>Bagman</strong> : a Cyberpunk series in the first-person narrative from different points of views. This series is rated <em>Mature</em> for drug-use, language, violence and strong sexual references. <strong>30471</strong> (in progress)</p>\n        <p><strong>The Gerideon Chronicles</strong> : An experiment in writing in a classical style reminiscent of Sir Thomas Malory's <em>Le Morte D'Arthur</em>. <strong>30988</strong> (in progress)</p>\n\n        <h3 class=\"section-title\">Completed Ficlets</h3>\n        <p><strong>The Fog</strong> : My response to Ana Cristina's <em>Out of Order Challenge</em> . <strong>33175</strong></p>\n        <p>Also check out my bro's ficlets! <a href=\"#\"><strong>Browncoatben</strong></a> ! He's not as good as me, but he wishes he was.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"story-list\">\n            <h2>Stories (79)</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"story-item\">\n                <a href=\"#\">Bagman: A Clear Blue Spike</a>\n                <p>Author: <a href=\"#\">JLaughter</a></p>\n                <p>Published May 14th, 2008</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"story-item\">\n                <a href=\"#\">Bagman: Fashionably Late</a>\n                <p>Author: <a href=\"#\">JLaughter</a></p>\n                <p>Published May 17th, 2008</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"story-item\">\n                <a href=\"#\">Bagman: First Rule: Never Ask</a>\n                <p>Author: <a href=\"#\">JLaughter</a></p>\n                <p>Published May 17th, 2008</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"story-item\">\n                <a href=\"#\">Bagman: Shots Fired</a>\n                <p>Author: <a href=\"#\">JLaughter</a></p>\n                <p>Published May 17th, 2008</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-left\">\n            <a href=\"#\">Ficlets</a>\n            <p>All stories are licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 License.</p>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"footer-nav\">\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Authors</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Stories</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\">Tags</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
